#: fd2120e0b47742de8908f098c7eb40fb
msgid ""
"The prior predictive distribution $p(y)$ represents our beliefs about the"
" data before we observe it. Mathematically, it's the distribution of the "
"data marginalized over the prior:"
msgstr ""
"La distribución predictiva previa $p(y)$ representa nuestras creencias "
"sobre los datos antes de observarlos. Matemáticamente, es la distribución"
" de los datos marginalizada sobre la previa:"

#: ../source/notebooks/general/prior_predictive.ipynb:10116
#: 2d02ea8adcc9443eb7c105aeefa679a6
msgid "p(y) = \\int p(y|\\theta)p(\\theta)d\\theta"
msgstr "p(y) = \\int p(y|\\theta)p(\\theta)d\\theta"

#: ../source/notebooks/general/prior_predictive.ipynb:10118
#: 61ab87f1b0ff457c8ce6fbcf9b01236e
